list.item:
Uniformity of the mechanism and of the means of credit: 
                            I.

—For the State;
                            II.

—For the central banks;
                            III.

—For public works or public services;
                            IV.

—For the encouragement of agricultural or industrial
                                production;
                            V.

—For the development of natural resources other than
                                agriculture;
                            IV [VI].

—For commercial traffic.
